# Dispel's Vengeance form, and the one the swap pays for outright: the skill it
# replaces cures conditions nothing in this game inflicts. GMS's 170+6x over
# ten levels, four feathers every three seconds.
#
# GMS sets them off by striking an enemy, on a three-second cooldown of their
# own. Here they simply fall on that clock: a Bishop with a swing to make is
# always striking something, so the two come to the same thing.
name: "Triumph Feather"
description:
  "Harness the power of the Angel of Victory. Angel feathers appear and seek "
  "out and attack nearby enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_VENGEANCE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PRIEST skill_order: 4 }
max_level: 10
replaces_skill_name: "Dispel"
toggle_skill_name: "Righteously Indignant"
max_enemies: 4
lines: 4
cast_interval_seconds: 3.0
base { skill_pct: 1.76 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.06 }
